  "description": "(3.3.0) Telnyx carrier adapter for CircleAI.Telephony. Number search + purchase + assignment, Call Control App webhook configuration, outbound dial with Media Streaming, hang up, cold transfer — all via Telnyx v2 REST API (Bearer-token auth). Media-stream WebSocket plumbing is host-supplied via the shared IMediaStream contract. Fail-soft when API key missing.",
